---
title: Bazinga Local Server - Components
---
graph TD
    subgraph CONNECTED["Connected Containers"]
        WEB[Web UI]
        STATE[(State Store)]
    end

    subgraph SERVER["Bazinga Local Server"]
        CHAT[Chat API]
        ARTIFACT_API[Artifact API]
        MODEL[Model Client]
        TOOLS[Tool Executor]
        PERSIST[Artifact Persistence]
    end

    subgraph EXT["External"]
        LLM[LLM Provider]
        ARTIFACTS[(Project Artifacts)]
    end

    WEB -->|session_id + message; WebSocket| CHAT
    WEB -->|Browse, read, list artifacts; HTTP| ARTIFACT_API
    CHAT -->|Conversation history + tool declarations| MODEL
    MODEL -->|HTTPS/gRPC| LLM
    MODEL -->|Tool calls| TOOLS
    TOOLS -->|Tool results| MODEL
    TOOLS -->|Saves diagrams, specs| PERSIST
    PERSIST -->|Writes to repo| ARTIFACTS
    ARTIFACT_API -->|Reads from repo| ARTIFACTS
    CHAT -->|Saves/loads session history| STATE
